# FreeDOS 1.3 floppy-edition install onto a blank -hda image (tools/expect.py)
# boot menu: take the default
Select from Menu	\r
proceed \[Y,N\]\?	y\r
reboot now \[Y,N\]\?	y\r
Select from Menu	\r
proceed \[Y,N\]\?	y\r
format your drive \[Y,N\]\?	y\r
ready to install|proceed \[Y,N\]\?	y\r
Insert diskette #2	\x1b+\r
Insert diskette containing file A:.FREEDOS.024	\x1b+\r
Insert diskette containing file A:.FREEDOS.048	\x1b+\r
Insert diskette containing file A:.FREEDOS.072	\x1b+\r
Insert diskette containing file A:.FREEDOS.096	\x1b+\r
# done: answer N (no reboot); the disk is complete
has completed[\s\S]*reboot now \[Y,N\]\?	n\r
